# Templates the Combat Manager NPCs apply, written from the rules on Archives of Nethys (aonprd.com)

Id Mutant ~ Mutations	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Extraordinary	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	DESC:An id mutant gains one natural attack (bite, claw, gore, slam or talon), one bonus feat among Great Fortitude, Iron Will, Lightning Reflexes and Toughness, and one mutation per 3 points of adjusted CR: additional movement, additional natural attack, aquatic, blindsense 30 ft., ferocious, infectious (curse of bestial dreams), scent, swift (+20 ft.), tentacled (CR 10+) or thick hide (DR 2/piercing). Choose them from its stat block.	SOURCEPAGE:p.29
